se,"primary_selected":false}],"textures":[{"name":"armour_hobgoblin.png","path":"","relative_path":"","folder":"","namespace":"","id":"0","group":"","scope":0,"width":128,"height":32,"uv_width":128,"uv_height":32,"particle":false,"use_as_default":false,"layers_enabled":false,"sync_to_project":"","file_format":"png","render_mode":"default","render_sides":"auto","wrap_mode":"limited","pbr_channel":"color","fps":7,"frame_time":1,"frame_order_type":"loop","frame_order":"","frame_interpolate":false,"visible":true,"internal":true,"saved":false,"uuid":"1cb6c2f5-a02e-52ff-f6b0-d5893324c0af","source":"data:image/png;base64,"}],"description":"## armour_hobgoblin\n\nArmour, worn by troops (Patch 7 loot).\n\n- Cubes: 24 (0 rotated). Texture 128x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -11.9..11.9, y 5.0..66.0, z -5.6..5.0 (size 23.8 x 61.0 x 10.6 u = 67 x 172 x 30 cm).\nThe hobgoblin's iron set (`hobgoblin.bbmodel`: `gear_helm`, `gear_cuirass`, `gear_pauldron_left/right`, `gear_bracer_left/right`, `gear_greave_left/right`), redrawn to fit warrior_base: a crested iron helm with brow band, nasal and cheek guards on `head`; four iron scale bands and a backplate on `torso`; the two faulds on `leg_upper_r/l`, so the thighs never pass through them; pauldrons with a side lame on `arm_upper_r/l`; leather bracers on `arm_lower_r/l`; iron greaves on `leg_lower_r/l`. Every face is resampled from the hobgoblin's own texture at 1 px per unit, so the colours and pixel style are its own. A team-colour sash (`team_sash`, RGB 52, 96, 178) with the hobgoblin's buckle is worn at the waist, as on the ladder armour, so the unit keeps its team colour. Same bones and pivots as warrior_base. Patch 7 loot.\n"}